msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**AI experience differs from developer experience** - tools must target the "
"agent as the primary user"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Skills guide agents effectively** - well-crafted skills dramatically "
"improve agent performance"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**MCP provides standardization** - the Model Context Protocol enables tool "
"interoperability"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Documentation integration is crucial** - agents need access to accurate, "
"version-specific documentation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Extension developers play a key role** - quality skills and Dev MCP "
"methods enhance the ecosystem"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**Review is still essential** - agents are collaborators, not replacements "
